"""Layer 1 MLP down_proj component 5048.

Reads nothing from other components. It is a progressive-verb detector with a sign: it is strongly
negative on the -ing verb of a progressive after a form of "be" ("I'm going", "we're trying",
"what's going on"), and about -1 on other -ing verbs after "be" or after not/also/still/just.
It is positive, about +4, on the word that completes an idiom built on get/go/set, such as
"get started", "go wrong", "go about", "get involved", "get ready", "get comfortable".
"take into account" gets -3.5 on "into". Everything else is 0.
